class.description:
[method SQLiteDatabase.get_columns] returns one [SQLiteColumn] per column of a table, in table order. All properties are read-only: an [SQLiteColumn] describes the table as it was when [method SQLiteDatabase.get_columns] was called and does not change with it.
[codeblock]
for column in db.get_columns("items"):
	var text = column.name + " " + column.declared_type
	if column.primary_key_index > 0:
		text += " (key)"
	if column.not_null:
		text += " NOT NULL"
	print(text)
[/codeblock]
